2026-08-11 16:08:53,695 INFO ipython # check redis sessions with bad user
2026-08-11 16:08:53,696 INFO ipython import frappe.cache_manager
2026-08-11 16:08:53,696 INFO ipython keys = frappe.cache.hkeys("session") or []
2026-08-11 16:08:53,696 INFO ipython bad = []
2026-08-11 16:08:53,696 INFO ipython for sid in keys[:50]:
    data = frappe.cache.hget("session", sid)
    if data and isinstance(data, dict):
        u = data.get("user") or (data.get("data") or {}).get("user")
        if not u or u == "None":
            bad.append((sid, u))
print("Bad redis sessions:", len(bad), bad[:5])
2026-08-11 16:08:53,696 INFO ipython === session end ===
